# Re-include selected test files for semgrep architectural-lint rules.
#
# Semgrep's built-in default .semgrepignore excludes ``test_*.py`` and
# ``tests/`` so external rule packs aren't noisy on test code.  Our
# ``e2e-page-evaluate-must-use-helper`` and
# ``e2e-locator-screenshot-must-use-safe-screenshot`` rules in
# ``.semgrep/foxess-architecture.yaml`` SPECIFICALLY target test-body
# code, so the defaults must be overridden for that path.
#
# Pattern syntax: a leading ``!`` re-includes a path that an earlier
# rule (or the implicit defaults) excluded.
!tests/e2e/test_ui.py
!tests/e2e/test_e2e.py
!tests/e2e/conftest.py
